    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50831" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππό-στᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				13.8.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.307
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.184
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1368.46
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀελίου κνεφαία
				ἱππόστασις</span> the dark <i>stable</i> of the Sun, i.e.
			the West, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				594
			</span></i> (lyr.); but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἕω φαεννὰς Ἡλίου θ᾽
				ἱπποστάσεις</span>, of the East, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				771.5
			</span></i>.</div>
